OL,3,GNEWSALake too shallow for water sports
OL,4,Aas levels drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater levels at one of Cornwall's
OL,7,Fbiggest reservoirs remain very low,
OL,8,Fmeaning much of it cannot be used for
OL,9,Fwater sports.
OL,11,FStithians lake near Redruth is
OL,12,Fcurrently 27% full following a long,
OL,13,Fdry summer and South West Water said
OL,14,F"sustained rainfall over a number of
OL,15,Fmonths" was needed for storage levels
OL,16,Fto "significantly improve". More than
OL,17,F250,000 people in south and west
OL,18,FCornwall get their water from
OL,19,FStithians.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
