OL,3,GNEWSALake too shallow for water sports
OL,4,Aas levels drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lake is used by wing foiling riders
OL,7,Fand paddleboarders, and chief water
OL,8,Fsports instructor at the lake, Lark
OL,9,FBridges, said part of the site was "too
OL,10,Fshallow" for equipment.
OL,12,F"There are underwater hazards so we've
OL,13,Fclosed that off for safety reasons,"
OL,14,FBridges said.
